\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs28\b IFR: Investment Financial Reporting \endash  Happy Paths\b0\fs22\par
\par
\b0 Source:\b0  IFR Current State process flow diagrams (APT/SPECTR, EBR, SRDE, Advices, Statement Compliance).\par
\b0 Document scope:\b0  New IFR Azure modernization project \endash  standalone from other workstreams.\par
\b0 Success paths only.\b0  Quadient and physical print are NOT IN SCOPE.\par
\b0 Target platform:\b0  Azure Data Factory + Azure Functions + Azure SQL + Azure Files.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 1. Technology Overview (IFR project)\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120\sl276\slmult1 Azure Data Factory \endash  Replaces Windows Scheduler; orchestration, dependencies, retries\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Azure Functions \endash  EBRProcess, ProcessEBRSchedule, ProcessAdvices, APT/SPECTR PDF, compliance jobs\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Azure Files \endash  Trigger files, flat files, extracts, archive (FTP replacement)\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Azure SQL \endash  IFR (MTB_APT, MTB_SPECTR), ODREXT, IFD_Conv, OLS / IFR_V2\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Azure Key Vault + Managed Identity \endash  Connection strings, API credentials\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}PDFSharp \endash  APT-to-PDF and Spectr-to-PDF (as-is conversion per diagram)\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}SEI ODT API \endash  External API for SRDE schedule path\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Bulk load / BCP activities \endash  TABLOAD (inbound) and TABDUMP (outbound) patterns\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Application Insights + ADF monitoring \endash  Operational logging and alerts\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 2. APT and SPECTR \endash  Happy Path\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0 Legacy:\b0  APT and SPECTR inputs; APT-to-PDF / Spectr-to-PDF; metadata in IFR (MTB_APT, MTB_SPECTR); archive to OLS (OLS retiring).\par
\par
\b\fs24 Flow\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120 ADF or file-arrival trigger starts APT/SPECTR processing.\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Read APT / SPECTR source files from Azure File Share.\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Convert to PDF using PDFSharp (as-is; optional logo/bold/underline transforms per diagram note).\par
{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Store file metadata in Azure SQL (MTB_APT / MTB_SPECTR schemas; target DB TBD after IFR retirement).\par
{\pntext\f0 5.\tab}Archive PDF and metadata (replacement for OLS archive).\par
{\pntext\f0 6.\tab}Complete successfully.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 Technologies\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720 ADF, Azure Functions, PDFSharp, Azure Files, Azure SQL\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 3. EBR \endash  Happy Path\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0 Legacy:\b0  Windows Scheduler (Tue\endash Sat); EBRProcess; trigger file; Line Data Input; IFD_Conv. Quadient NOT IN SCOPE.\par
\par
\b\fs24 Flow\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120 ADF schedule triggers EBR workflow (replaces Windows Scheduler).\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}EBRProcess runs and monitors for required input / trigger file on Azure File Share.\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}When trigger file is present, EBRProcess produces or validates trigger file for downstream use.\par
{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Line Data Input step loads or stages data into IFD_Conv.\par
{\pntext\f0 5.\tab}Downstream ADF pipeline completes EBR processing.\par
{\pntext\f0 6.\tab}Complete successfully.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 Technologies\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720 ADF, Azure Functions (EBRProcess), Azure Files, Azure SQL (IFD_Conv)\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 4. SRDE \endash  Happy Path\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0 Legacy:\b0  SEI ODT API; ProcessEBRSchedule; ODREXT; SRDE flat file TABLOAD to IFD_Conv. Quadient NOT IN SCOPE.\par
\par
\b\fs24 Flow \endash  API path\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120 ADF invokes SEI ODT API.\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}ProcessEBRSchedule updates ODREXT (OLTP schema).\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Trigger file written to Azure File Share for downstream steps if required.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 Flow \endash  TABLOAD path\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120 SRDE flat file arrives on Azure File Share.\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}TABLOAD activity bulk loads file into IFD_Conv.\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Load completes successfully.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 Technologies\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720 ADF, SEI ODT API, Azure Functions, Azure SQL (ODREXT, IFD_Conv), Azure Files, bulk load (BCP/SqlBulkCopy)\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 5. Advices \endash  Happy Path\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0 Legacy:\b0  Windows Scheduler; ProcessAdvices; stored procedure in ODREXT; text file output. Physical print NOT IN SCOPE.\par
\par
\b\fs24 Flow\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120 ADF schedule triggers ProcessAdvices.\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}ProcessAdvices calls stored procedure in ODREXT.\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Text file output written to Azure File Share.\par
{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Complete successfully (digital file only).\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 Technologies\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720 ADF, Azure Functions or ADF Stored Procedure activity, Azure SQL (ODREXT), Azure Files\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 6. Statement Compliance \endash  Happy Path\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0 Legacy:\b0  Daily OLS refresh (spr_Stmt_Non_Compliant_Daily_Refresh); TABDUMP to COM11; monthly StmtComplianceRpt.exe (20th, to be retired). OLS \endash  IFR_V2 migration TBD.\par
\par
\b\fs24 Flow \endash  Daily\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120 ADF daily job: OLS \endash  Refresh Statement Compliance Tables.\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Execute spr_Stmt_Non_Compliant_Daily_Refresh on OLS (future: IFR_V2).\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}TABDUMP exports compliance data to COM11 landing zone.\par
{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Complete successfully.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 Flow \endash  Monthly\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}\fi-360\li720\sa120 ADF schedule on 20th of month (replaces StmtComplianceRpt.exe).\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Same refresh / extract logic as daily job.\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Extract delivered to downstream consumer (mainframe use \endash  confirm with business).\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 Technologies\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720 ADF, Azure Functions or ADF SQL activity, Azure SQL (OLS / IFR_V2), TABDUMP/BCP, Azure Files (COM11)\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 7. End-to-End IFR Platform (diagram view)\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs20 ADF Schedule / Event\par
  -> EBRProcess / ProcessEBRSchedule / ProcessAdvices (Azure Functions)\par
  -> SEI ODT API (SRDE API path)\par
  -> TABLOAD / TABDUMP (bulk in/out)\par
  -> APT/SPECTR PDF pipeline\par
  -> Azure SQL (IFR, ODREXT, IFD_Conv, OLS/IFR_V2)\par
  -> Azure Files (trigger files, flat files, extracts)\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 8. Out of Scope (per diagram)\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720 Quadient \endash  .TNO / .PDF generation and FTP to RR Donnelley\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Advices physical print on M&T letterhead\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs26 9. Information Still Required for Build\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\fi-360\li720 Stored procedure definitions and parameters\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}File layouts, naming conventions, and trigger file format\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}SEI ODT API contracts and authentication\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}Exact schedules (EBR, Advices, compliance daily/monthly)\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}OLS to IFR_V2 migration plan and target database\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
